ks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E2sc3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f40ba74-d53c-47f8-a655-8e915859d7e5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なんでnotifyを使っていたんだろ","ts":"1630673404.242800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O2B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba92dac0-429c-4460-8f0f-5d989e6c30a6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"いつもnotifyを使っていた","ts":"1630673369.242500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FeJwl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0322b7b7-ce2b-427c-b821-14713abf8f82","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"おお、まさに欲しかったやつだ","ts":"1630673364.242300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sIZG"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *denops#request()*\ndenops#request({plugin}, {method}, {params})\n        Call API {method} of {plugin} with {params} and wait a result and\n        return it.\n        Use |denops#notify()| instead if you don't need a result.\n        Use |denops#request_async()| instead if you need a result\n        asynchronously.\n```","ts":"1630673341.242000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"fed81ec0-3f36-49b4-a5c8-4d441d266e67","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h denops#request()","ts":"1630673340.241900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w3yYO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1d474c2-58be-4cc7-93e5-4d31785cc4e0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"customlistにしたら配列を受け取るようになるけど自分で候補の選定をしないといけないらしいからなー…","ts":"1630673336.241700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xUDL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5e1657c-bf1a-4580-9de7-41eb9a40f3dd","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"denops#requestってなんだっけな…","ts":"1630673315.241500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tub"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6edd8923-fa9e-4ff7-be3a-de2232e94c05","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1630673301.241000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zg/9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0740edc2-77fe-4f9e-bf11-fe635410d492","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`return denops#request(\"my-great-plugin\", \"very-sugoi-completion\", [a:A, a:L, a:P])`みたいな感じに投げ付けてdenops側で処理して返したらよさそう","ts":"1630673290.240800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ow9e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5e5ab25-1e84-41c6-86f3-43e8510acf59","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"tab補完するとコンテナ一覧が表示されるメージです","ts":"1630673288.240700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tVClt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1a77a10-ad83-4535-974e-f62de914889f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"やりたいことは↓のようなコマンドで、tab補完をしたい、です\n```DockerAttachContainer```","ts":"1630673271.240100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sglJK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"acfd0758-29b0-4d3b-a701-9dc942957b44","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"（説明がへたですいません）","ts":"1630673186.238600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T=8qB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1328739c-6c0d-4ff1-866b-06bde74170b8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"↓でいうと return system 部分でdenopsの処理結果を返したいというイメージです\n```    :com -complete=custom,ListUsers -nargs=1 Finger !finger \u0026lt;args\u0026gt;\n    :fun ListUsers(A,L,P)\n    :    return system(\"cut -d: -f1 /etc/passwd\")\n    :endfun```","ts":"1630673147.238200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"13qm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60dc33a5-df27-4cbe-89fe-578ce49ddc65","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"その補完関数で配列を返したいんですよね","ts":"1630673105.237400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v9x5M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ce2243c-9d54-42a1-81bd-7f675d89cde3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"補完に関数指定できるからそれでdenops側にrequest投げたらよさそうな気がする","ts":"1630672961.236900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fuS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20241D3D-4BFA-486D-A1DE-A06EEE4E9693","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"こちらについて質問ですが、denops側の処理結果(例えば文字列の配列)をコマンド補完コマンで返して、自作コマンドでtab補完したいんですが、可能でしょうか？\n\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1630565717230900|https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1630565717230900\u003e","ts":"1630672838.236300","attachments":[{"fallback":"[September 1st, 2021 11:55 PM] sho19921005: そういえば、denops-docker.vimでコマンドの補完関数でコンテナ一覧を取得して返したいけど\n良いやり方が浮かばない","id":1,"author_id":"UDDCM376D","author_name":"ゴリラ（コンパイラ入門中）","author_subname":"ゴリラ（コンパイラ入門中）","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/UDDCM376D","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2021-01-06/1621211956228_09947ad089d6e790ca09_48.png","text":"そういえば、denops-docker.vimでコマンドの補完関数でコンテナ一覧を取得して返したいけど\n良いやり方が浮かばない","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-denops","ts":1630565717.230900,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1630565717230900","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1630565717230900"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K/6vS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6eab80ec-7aab-4180-9260-eb4